  "domain": "artificial-intelligence",
  "definition": "Multimodal AI refers to machine learning systems that process and integrate information from multiple data modalities \u2014 including text, images, audio, and video \u2014 simultaneously to produce contextually richer outputs than single-modality systems. These architectures employ specialised neural network fusion techniques to replicate the human brain's capacity to synthesise diverse sensory inputs, enabling applications in healthcare diagnostics, human-computer interaction, and cross-modal content generation.",
